.TH DIALOG_DONE 3 "generalGameEngine" "Engine Manual" "Engine Manual"
.SH NAME
dialog_done \- True when no line is showing: initially, and after the player dismissed the last one
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include \(dqdialog.h\(dq
.BI "bool dialog_done(const Dialog *d);"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
True when no line is showing: initially, and after the player dismissed the last one. Poll it in update to start the next line of a conversation or to resume gameplay.
.PP
This is a static inline function; it is defined in the header.
.SH RETURN VALUE
!d\->active.
.SH MODULE
dialog (src/engine/dialog/dialog.h)
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR dialog_show (3),
.BR dialog_update (3),
.BR gge\-api (7),
.BR gge (1)
